    "body": "Right, this seems like something we should make sure is tested, but should not require specification changes. The point of base appearance is that you don't use a custom render object (is there a specification term for that?).\n\n(WebKit seems to put the `::picker-icon` in the wrong place in the `Base` case. Chromium looks correct.)",
