    "updated_at": "2026-06-10T21:10:04Z",
    "body": "Thanks for bringing this up. I have made several changes with WPTs so far to remove magic clipping stuff:\n- https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/92fac8b90f93ee37791c002e70663cff605de0fc\n- https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src.git/+/fe157efc87b8bc7597dfdfa4ee86a3e1f3dc3e4e\n\nI agree with Anne that the spec is probably in a good state, I'm not sure what else I would change to spell out that base appearance doesn't have extra styles or custom layout code for the div which holds the text.",
